    <string name="settings_keepalive_pixel_desc">掛載 1x1 像素透明懸浮窗，提升進程為可見視窗優先級（需懸浮窗權限）</string>
    <string name="settings_keepalive_wakelock">CPU 防休眠喚醒鎖</string>
    <string name="settings_keepalive_wakelock_desc">持有系統 Partial WakeLock 保證 CPU 持續運行，防止在熄屏時進入深度休眠</string>
    <string name="settings_keepalive_alarm_job">定時作業與精準鬧鐘</string>
    <string name="settings_keepalive_alarm_job_desc">結合 JobScheduler 系統作業與 AlarmManager 鬧鐘在 Doze 模式下週期性喚醒進程</string>
    <string name="settings_keepalive_daemon_broadcast">雙進程守護</string>
    <string name="settings_keepalive_daemon_broadcast_desc">獨立守護子進程與主進程互相監聽 Binder 死亡並拉活，同時監聽開機、解鎖與電源事件</string>
    <string name="settings_keepalive_companion">伴侶設備服務</string>
    <string name="settings_keepalive_companion_desc">註冊系統伴侶設備組件，享有系統級免殺與後台網路喚醒豁免</string>
    <string name="settings_keepalive_accessibility">無障礙守護聯動</string>
